{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_78_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_78","textTraditional":"一、十有五年，春，王正月，公如齊。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_78_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_78","textTraditional":"二、楚人伐徐。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_78_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_78","textTraditional":"三、三月，公會齊侯、宋公、陳侯、衞侯、鄭伯、許男、曹伯盟於牡丘。遂次於匡。公孫敖帥師及諸侯之大夫救徐。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_78_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_78","textTraditional":"兵車之會也。遂，繼事也。次，止也，有畏也。善救徐也。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_78_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_78","textTraditional":"四、夏，五月，日有食之。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_78_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_78","textTraditional":"五、秋，七月，齊師、曹師伐厲。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_78_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_78","textTraditional":"六、八月，螽。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_78_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_78","textTraditional":"螽，蟲災也。甚則月，不甚則時。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_clt_78_9","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_78","textTraditional":"七、九月，公至自會。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_clt_78_10","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_78","textTraditional":"八、季姬歸於繒。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_clt_78_11","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_78","textTraditional":"九、己卯，晦，震夷伯之廟。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_clt_78_12","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_78","textTraditional":"晦，冥也。震，雷也。夷伯，魯大夫也。因此以見天子至於士皆有廟。天子七廟，諸侯五，大夫三，士二。故德厚者流光，德薄者流卑。是以貴始，德之本也。始封必為祖。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_clt_78_13","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_78","textTraditional":"十、冬，宋人伐曹。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_clt_78_14","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_78","textTraditional":"十一、楚人敗徐於婁林。","sentenceOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_clt_78_15","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_78","textTraditional":"夷狄相敗，志也。","sentenceOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_clt_78_16","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_78","textTraditional":"十二、十有一月，壬戌，晉侯及秦伯戰於韓，獲晉侯。","sentenceOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_clt_78_17","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_78","textTraditional":"韓之戰，晉侯失民矣，以其民未敗而君獲也。","sentenceOrder":17}],"overrides":{}}